    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43729" root="&#xA;                        منع&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            5
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَنَّعَ مِنَ الشَّىْءِ بِقَّوْمِهِ</span></b> 
                         and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمْتَنَعَ</span></b> 
                        <i>He became
strengthened,</i> or <i>fortified, against the thing by
his people,</i> or <i>party;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَوَّى</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَنَّعَ عَنْهُ</span>
                        <i>He refrained, forbore,</i> or <i>abstained,
from it, as being forbidden,</i> or <i>prohibited.</i>
(K, * TA.) See 8. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَنَّعَ بِهِ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمتنع</span></b> 
                        <i>he protected,</i> or <i>defended, himself by it,</i> namely
a fortress; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِحْتَمَى</span>. (TA.)

